        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi ndaleta cilanga munyika amuzilundu zyoonse, ndabuzya maila awaini amafuta amicelo yoonse iizwa muvu, ndakataazya bantu aŋombe zyoonse amilimo yabo yoonse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
