        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Zerubabeli mwana wa-Sealitiyeli, a-Joshua mwana wa-Jehozadaki mupaizi mupati, abantu basyeede boonse, bakazuminina ijwi lyaJehova Leza wabo amajwi aa-Hagai musinsimi, mbubonya mbuli Jehova Leza wabo mbwaakamutuma. Bantu bakayoowa kubusyu bwa-Jehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.12"
            ]
