        {
          "text": "Nkabela Jehova wakabusya moyo wa-Zerubabeli mwana wa-Sealitiyeli mweendelezi wa-Juda, amoyo wa-Joshua mwana wa-Jehozadaki mupaizi mupati, amyoyo yabantu boonse basyeede, aboobo bakeza kuzoobeleka milimo yaŋanda ya-Jehova wamakamu Leza wabo, ",
          "type": "text",
